given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Rowland-Jones</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Champlin</surname><given-names>RE</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2002</year><article-title>Cytomegalovirus reactivation following allogeneic stem cell transplantation is associated with the presence of dysfunctional antigen-specific CD8&#x0002b; T cells.</article-title><source>Blood</source><volume>100</volume><fpage>3690</fpage><lpage>3697</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12393402</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0003634-Boeckh1"><label>9</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Boeckh</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Leisenring</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Riddell</surname><given-names>SR</given-names></name><name><surname>Bowden</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name><name><surname>Huang</surname><given-names>ML</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2003</year><article-title>Late cytomegalovirus disease and mortality in recipients of allogeneic hematopoietic stem cell transplants: importance of viral load and T-cell immunity.</article-title><source>Blood</source><volume>101</volume><fpage>407</fpage><lpage>414</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12393659</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0003634-Einsele2"><label>10</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Einsele</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Roosnek</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Rufer</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Sinzger</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Riegler</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2002</year><article-title>Infusion of cytomegalovirus (CMV)-specific T cells for the treatment of CMV infection not responding to antiviral chem